title: AWS v2 S3: Objects
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the objects of an AWS/S3 bucket and reports

 - the bucket size, in total and per storage class

 - the number of objects

 - the location and the tags of the bucket

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}.

 There are no default levels. Upper levels on the bucket size
 are configurable via the rule "AWS v2/S3 bucket objects".

discovery:
 Each bucket is a piggyback host with the name {<bucket name>}.
 One service is created on this host if all required metrics
 (BucketSizeBytes, NumberOfObjects) are given.
